            },
            "reviewBody": "Really good and paired well with Asian Orange Chicken I made from this site. I didn’t have the specified wine so I used 1/2 TBLS of rice wine vinegar and 1 TBLS of apple cider vinegar. Debated about adding some thinly sliced onions to the sauté but didn’t. I think I will next time. Super easy side dish! Thanks iken!",
